<title>BOLIVIA: BOLIVIA GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>BOLIVIA GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>BOLIVIA GOVERNMENT LIST (970807)</p>
<p>  President........................................Hugo BANZER</p>
<p>(Sworn in for 5-year term 6 Aug 97)</p>
<p>  Vice-President.................................Jorge QUIROGA</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>CABINET (Formed 31 Aug 95, Reshuffled 2 Dec 96)</p>
<p>MINISTERS:</p>
<p>  Capitalization.........................Alfonso REVOLLO (MNR)</p>
<p>  Defence...............................Alfonso KREIDLER (MNR)</p>
<p>  Economic Development................. Jaime VILLALOBOS (MNR)</p>
<p>  Finance.......................Fernando CANDIA Castillo (MNR)</p>
<p>  Foreign Relations.....................Antonio ARANIBAR (MBL)</p>
<p>  Interior................................Franklin ANAYA (MNR)</p>
